Actually, you were safer than you realized.

If you get killed while polymorphed into something, you don't die, you
just revert to human form.  The only real danger is that you might
get polymorphed into something which can't wear armor, and when you
return to human form, you're naked.  Sometimes it's better just to 
intentionally kill yourself (say by kicking a wall) and get back to
human right away.
